12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revision:6","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"7e7b05f63a8eb9008c2ec9f40fabf5d8ba570e08ef95d1d11b82a437157fa07d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充SAP中次要终点层级检验顺序及多重性调整方法","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_stat_01","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划"],"target":"多重性调整策略与层级检验顺序"},{"action":"确认主要终点及次要终点的缺失数据处理策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_stat_02","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划"],"target":"缺失数据处理方法"},{"action":"确认趋势检验方法（线性趋势、Emax模型或其他）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_stat_03","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划"],"target":"剂量-反应趋势检验具体方法"}],"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划（SAP）","多重性调整策略","缺失数据处理方法","亚组分析计划"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，采用1:1:1:1随机分配至KZ-sGC301低剂量（2.5 mg qd）、中剂量（5 mg qd）、高剂量（10 mg qd）及安慰剂组，治疗期12周。统计分析以全分析集（FAS）为主要分析集，遵循治疗策略估计目标，无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，采用协方差分析（ANCOVA）以基线NT-proBNP为协变量，同时检验剂量-反应趋势。安全性数据采用描述性统计方法汇总，包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压发生率、生命体征（血压、心率）变化、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标变化、12导联心电图异常。次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。本研究不设置期中分析，不设置样本量再估计，不设置独立数据监查委员会或安全审查委员会。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：FAS为主要分析集、ANCOVA基线校正检验主要终点并检验剂量-反应趋势、安全性描述统计、次要终点层级分析、治疗策略估计目标、无期中分析、无DMC、无SRC、1:1:1:1随机分配、12周治疗期、主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化。需医学经理确认：多重性调整策略及层级检验的具体顺序、缺失数据处理方法、剂量-反应趋势检验的具体方法、亚组分析计划、协变量选择依据、安全性终点中低血压的判定阈值。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_7e07ce00d90cfe0c","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005164900_6038a440","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revision:6","quote":"II期探索性设计：每组约60例（共约240例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。","quote_sha256":"7411ad614a6bc1e1b1bc03c65dcf06543f1df1ba65f37f430568a8bbbe339e96","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revision:6","quote":"随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC301三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"e74049f4ead353dd95e2261e3935b8e2b35c2288a7734bcab2c5a9c20218e4bb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es3"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es3"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"样本量","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期探索性设计，采用概念验证与剂量选择策略。样本量估算基于NT-proBNP组间差值的文献效应量，设定统计把握度为80%。每个治疗组（KZ-sGC301低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd及安慰剂）计划入组约60例，总样本量约240例。该样本量用于概念验证与剂量选择目的，不作为确证性研究的注册性样本量依据。随机分配比例为1:1:1:1，采用中央随机化系统进行区组随机。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：II期探索性设计、每组约60例共约240例、基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算、用于概念验证与剂量选择、1:1:1:1随机分配、三个剂量组与安慰剂对照。需医学经理确认：文献效应量的具体数值及来源文献、是否考虑脱落率放大、随机化是否按中心分层及区组大小。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（样本量）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_6d1c8ce42ca3ce04","section_number":"9.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005164900_6038a440","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revision:6","quote":"FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"067b3f77e20da2222b9c91da7106a0b612b21542c62f4e68cae8bb2ae7c09367","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revision:6","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"7e7b05f63a8eb9008c2ec9f40fabf5d8ba570e08ef95d1d11b82a437157fa07d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es2","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认SAP中是否包含符合方案集或可评价集","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ds_01","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划"],"target":"是否设置PPS或CES作为敏感性分析集"},{"action":"确认FAS是否要求至少一次给药、SS中交叉用药的处理","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ds_02","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划"],"target":"FAS与SS的精确定义边界"}],"heading":"统计分析数据集","missing_source_classes":["项目统计分析计划（SAP）"],"proposal_text":"本研究设置以下统计分析数据集。全分析集（FAS）：包含所有经随机化分组并至少接受一次研究药物或安慰剂给药的受试者，按随机分组进行分析，遵循治疗策略估计目标，无论是否发生剂量调整、合并用药变化或提前退出，均纳入FAS。FAS为本研究主要疗效分析集，主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化及次要终点均在FAS中进行分析。安全性分析集（SS）：包含所有至少接受一次研究药物或安慰剂给药的受试者，按实际接受的药物治疗进行分析，用于不良事件、严重不良事件、生命体征、实验室检查及心电图等安全性指标的描述性统计汇总。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：FAS为主要分析集、治疗策略估计目标（无论剂量调整或合并用药变化均按随机分组分析）、安全性采用描述统计。需医学经理确认：是否设置符合方案集或可评价集作为敏感性分析集；FAS中至少接受一次给药的界定是否包含仅接受安慰剂者；SS中按实际接受药物是否包含交叉用药情况；是否设置按剂量组的安全性分析子集。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_31c47cc3eaf95d3a","section_number":"9.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:r6:d11f75abadf3bca7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:40a436d9255d20","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c0e10622ed24c4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"1842de1f9fecc5992fd86cf6ccb70baef65c9e1822ff5181f73e4cd17a219d67","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bfcd0eec6505_f927261a33219afb:full-draft:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3f87ceafde944e2ec713e26648aa7ef819e9e8ac670e06347a68e5bd41c4378f:9769a9a712e235c0e94151c3","text_sha256":"1842de1f9fecc5992fd86cf6ccb70baef65c9e1822ff5181f73e4cd17a219d67"},{"content_sha256":"a5c234c66ffa681ed8f307ed255fd155024c266785578e33b159ac1456f7ea85","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5ce6022c419cf72077e2:revis